{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":39590258,"ns":0,"title":"Bridge bearing","extract":"In structural engineering, a bridge bearing is a component of a bridge which typically provides a resting surface between bridge piers and the bridge deck. The purpose of a bearing is to allow controlled movement and thereby reduce the stresses involved.","description":"Resting surface between the piers and deck of a bridge","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}